  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Process a Loan Originating from a Chatbot",
    "splashDescription": "Securing even a simple loan often takes up to five days and requires multiple customer interactions. This lending process blueprint drastically reduces this time and effort, ensuring funds are delivered faster when customers need them most. It provides a customizable foundation to simplify the process, shorten approval times, and enhance self-service through digital channels.",
